OL,3,CRod Stewart cancels remainder of US
OL,4,Ctour after heart operation
OL,6,FSir Rod Stewart has cancelled the
OL,7,Fremainder of his 2026 US tour after
OL,8,Fundergoing heart surgery.
OL,10,FThe 81-year-old singer will take four
OL,11,Fweeks off to recover after undergoing
OL,12,Fa coronary stent procedure,
OL,13,Feffectively cutting short the US and
OL,14,FMexico performances for the remainder
OL,15,Fof the year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
