OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786533508
OL,3,CRod Stewart cancels remainder of US
OL,4,Ctour after heart operation
OL,6,FHis tour was due to stretch into
OL,7,FSeptember, but the performer will now
OL,8,Ftake the next four weeks to
OL,9,F"recuperate and regain full fitness
OL,10,Fbefore returning to the stage", a
OL,11,Fspokesperson said.
OL,13,F"I'm already feeling better and very
OL,14,Fmuch on the mend," Stewart said in a
OL,15,Fstatement on Instagram. "I want to
OL,16,Fthank the doctors, nurses and everyone
OL,17,Fwho has taken such wonderful care of
OL,18,Fme."
