OL,3,CRod Stewart cancels remainder of US
OL,4,Ctour after heart operation
OL,6,FHe was scheduled to perform events
OL,7,Facross Ohio, Illinois and Mexico, as
OL,8,Fwell as a six-night stretch at Caesars
OL,9,FPalace in Las Vegas.
OL,11,FHis representatives said Stewart was
OL,12,F"doing very well" following the
OL,13,Fprocedure and had "returned to his
OL,14,Fnormal daily activities".
OL,16,FThe statement added: "On the advice of
OL,17,Fhis doctors, he will take the next
OL,18,Ffour weeks to recuperate and regain
OL,19,Ffull fitness before returning to the
OL,20,Fstage.
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@QO]uD@SOUvD@XO]xD@VOU
