OL,3,CRod Stewart cancels remainder of US
OL,4,Ctour after heart operation
OL,6,F"Unfortunately, this means he will be
OL,7,Funable to continue his current tour
OL,8,Fdates. Information regarding affected
OL,9,Fperformances will be communicated by
OL,10,Fthe respective promoters and venues."
OL,12,FTwo further dates in Colorado are
OL,13,Fscheduled for September 2027.
OL,15,FThe announcement came after Stewart
OL,16,Fpostponed shows in Cincinnati and
OL,17,FCleveland following medical concerns.
