OL,3,CRod Stewart cancels remainder of US
OL,4,Ctour after heart operation
OL,6,FCleveland's Rocket Arena earlier
OL,7,Fconfirmed the cancellation on social
OL,8,Fmedia, writing: "Following a period of
OL,9,Fmonitoring, doctors have advised Rod
OL,10,FStewart to rest for at least 48 hours.
OL,12,F"As a result, his performance tomorrow
OL,13,Fnight, August 11, 2026 at Rocket Arena
OL,14,Fin Cleveland has been cancelled.
OL,16,F"Rod is disappointed to miss the show
OL,17,Fand appreciates everyone's
OL,18,Funderstanding. He looks forward to
OL,19,Freturning to the stage soon."
OL,26,@pD@QOUtD@AOUxD@AOU{D@]O]
