OL,3,CRod Stewart cancels remainder of US
OL,4,Ctour after heart operation
OL,6,FHealth problems had also forced the
OL,7,Fcancellation and postponement of shows
OL,8,Fin May and June.
OL,10,FIn May, the Maggie May singer sent
OL,11,F"apologies to my family of fans" in a
OL,12,Fstatement to the Las Vegas Review-
OL,13,FJournal after cancelling performances
OL,14,Fin Nevada, adding: "I am on vocal rest
OL,15,Fas I recover from a sinus infection."
OL,17,FLess than a month later, he cancelled
OL,18,Fhis San Diego show after being
OL,19,Fdiagnosed with a respiratory infection
OL,20,Fthat resulted in laryngitis.
